{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>彭博社周二（20日）援引知情官員報道，英國將向沙特阿拉伯部署皇家空軍颱風戰鬥機（Eurofighter），保護該國城市和基礎設施免受也門胡塞武裝組織空襲。</p><p>匿名英國官員向彭博社透露，首相貝安德（Andy Burnham）已要求皇家空軍執行防禦性任務。除戰鬥機外，英國還將向沙特派出一架Atlas A400M空中運輸機及軍事顧問。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.157606+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":0,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:36:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T20:58:15.090478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:51.628037+00:00","content_hash":"b34fd203f26fcebc2c005844b5f585c16f98d60ec247dcda17e98ebd957c3e8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}